
%9Syntax:%9

@SYNTAX:wcall@

%9Description:%9

    Closes all the queries of the active server and prints how many were
    closed. Queries on other servers are left open. The command needs an
    active server. Any parameters are ignored.

    A window left empty is closed as well when autoclose_windows is ON,
    which is the default.

%9Examples:%9

    /WCALL

%9See also:%9 QUERY, UNQUERY, WINDOW

